  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/pyjs1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Re-ran the item's own fixture (fx_rabod, e2-e5 required by main.js) @100b6fbb6e: e2 -> only method foo (bar/baz/qux/quxImpl absent, bar appears only as external_symbol javascript:e2:bar); e3 -> only method draw, qualified_name 'draw', no Widget; e4 -> nothing (an external 'default' stub); e5 -> nothing (external 'inline'). Identical to the filed observation. MECHANISM: function/class expressions as an assignment RHS or object-literal pair value are not extracted as symbols. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-piror,WI-gafaj."  # 15c0
